Error [E0628]: `wrap` is the item this module takes from the file `wrap`, so `wrap.decorate` reaches nothing
  --> text/module.jet:5:38
    |
  5 | fn quiet(s: String) -> String { wrap.decorate(s) }
    |                                      ^^^^^^^^
 Why: `use wrap.wrap` gives the name `wrap` to the file's item; the file `wrap` is still reached at the start of a `use` path
 Fix: Bring the item in with `use wrap.decorate` and call `decorate` directly, or publish it too with `pub use wrap.decorate`.
